re`\n   - Input validation failure increments metric\n   - Output validation failure increments metric\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Validation occurs at correct lifecycle points\n- Invalid input prevents agent spawning\n- Invalid output is logged but doesn\'t block\n- Metrics properly tracked\n\n**File**: `tests/integration/test_spawn_validation_integration.py`\n\n---\n\n### Test Task T2.2: Recovery Agent Permission Enforcement Tests\n**Description**: Test that Recovery Agent can only spawn Executive Director.\n\n**Test Cases**:\n1. `test_recovery_agent_can_spawn_executive_director`\n   - Recovery Agent spawning Executive Director succeeds\n   \n2. `test_recovery_agent_cannot_spawn_dev_manager`\n   - Recovery Agent spawning Dev Manager is rejected\n   \n3. `test_recovery_agent_cannot_spawn_code_writer`\n   - Recovery Agent spawning code_writer is rejected\n   \n4. `test_recovery_agent_cannot_spawn_coordinator`\n   - Recovery Agent spawning any coordinator is rejected\n   \n5. `test_permission_error_message_clear`\n   - Permission denial error clearly states what agent can/cannot spawn\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Permission enforcement working correctly\n- Only Executive Director can be spawned\n- Clear error messages on permission denial\n\n**File**: `tests/integration/test_recovery_agent_permissions.py`\n\n---\n\n## Test Fixtures\n\n### Test Task T3.1: Create Recovery Agent Test Fixtures\n**Description**: Create reusable test fixtures for Recovery Agent testing.\n\n**Fixtures to Create**:\n1. `valid_recovery_task_input()` - Returns valid RecoveryTaskInput dict\n2. `valid_recovery_agent_input()` - Returns valid RecoveryAgentInput dict\n3. `valid_recovery_agent_output()` - Returns valid RecoveryAgentOutput dict\n4. `recovery_task_factory(**overrides)` - Factory to create inputs with overrides\n5. `invalid_recovery_input_missing_field(field_name)` - Input with specified field missing\n6. `invalid_recovery_strategy_input()` - Input with invalid recovery strategy\n