{"timestamp": "2026-01-14 23:30:35", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-e2834686-3839-4616-9d0b-c2e0719acb28', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "task": "Create test fixtures and unit tests for Recovery Agent definition parsing. Tests should verify the recovery_agent.md file exists and contains all required sections: Purpose, Instructions, Permissions, Input Format, Output Format, Termination Conditions. Tests should verify permissions explicitly set can_spawn to [\'leadership/executive_director\'], can_write_code: false, can_write_tests: false.",\n  "test_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/tests/unit/test_recovery_agent_definition.py",\n  "code_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/ensemble/docs/agents/leadership/recovery_agent.md",\n  "fixture_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/tests/fixtures/recovery_agent_fixtures.py",\n  "test_framework": "pytest",\n  "requirements": "Test the recovery_agent.md agent definition file parsing: 1) File exists at expected path, 2) Contains Purpose section, 3) Contains Instructions section, 4) Contains Permissions section with can_spawn: [\'leadership/executive_director\'], can_write_code: false, can_write_tests: false, 5) Contains Input Format section, 6) Contains Output Format section, 7) Contains Termination Conditions section"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Lnp9K1DMaCwmWMFKgsEjYU', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/ensemble/docs/agents/leadership/recovery_agent.md