{"timestamp": "2026-01-15 01:30:59", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-30336e1f-3dda-4c14-8bfa-336b1be61f16', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 50, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'On the front end, in the "Agent Tasks pane - we see "exec_dir_1" - we want to see the name! Also, make the agent type a tag, and always show the whimsical name please. And please expand the list of whimsical names! Go nuts but keep it family friendly. Add a leaderboard to the achievements page that organizes by username, and generate achievements related to creative usernames!'}], 'model': 'claude-3-haiku-20240307', 'system': 'You are a title generator. Generate a concise 5-10 word title that summarizes the main task or goal in the user\'s prompt.\n\nRules:\n- Return ONLY the title, nothing else\n- No quotes, periods, or other punctuation\n- Use action verbs when possible (Build, Create, Fix, Add, Implement)\n- Be specific but brief\n- If the prompt is about code, mention the technology/language if relevant\n\nExamples:\n- "Build user authentication with JWT tokens"\n- "Fix pagination bug in product listing"\n- "Add dark mode toggle to settings page"\n- "Implement real-time chat with WebSockets"\n- "Create REST API for user management"\n'}}"}
