{"timestamp": "2026-01-15 01:31:13", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-ab89b6e9-c408-4cfd-a076-8f9062ab43ec', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "On the front end, in the \\"Agent Tasks pane - we see \\"exec_dir_1\\" - we want to see the name! Also, make the agent type a tag, and always show the whimsical name please. And please expand the list of whimsical names! Go nuts but keep it family friendly. Add a leaderboard to the achievements page that organizes by username, and generate achievements related to creative usernames!",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01JDnDjuXdVR3duh7LdT7Jph', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Agent Tasks UI Enhancement', 'description': 'Enhance agent tasks pane with readable names, agent type tags, expanded whimsical names, and add achievements leaderboard with creative username achievements'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01JDnDjuXdVR3duh7LdT7Jph', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "b2014ee2", "message": "Created project: Agent Tasks UI Enhancement", "summary": {"project_id": "b2014ee2", "project_name": "Agent Tasks UI Enhancement", "description": "Enhance agent tasks pane with readable names, agent type tags, expanded whimsical names, and add achievements leaderboard with creative username achievements", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-15T